---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Cookies" lang="en">
  <section class="page-shell">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="h1">Cookies</h1>
      <p class="intro">We keep this site verifiable and minimally automated: no ad profiling, no cross-site tracking. This page explains cookies and local storage that may be used on this site.</p>
      <div class="divider"></div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="prose">
          <h2 class="h2">1. Do we use cookies?</h2>
          <p>The site is mostly public pages. We do not set cookies for advertising or cross-site tracking.</p>
          <p>However, the browser or our infrastructure may set <strong>essential cookies</strong> in these cases:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Security & abuse prevention</strong>: hosting/CDN providers (e.g., Cloudflare) may set security cookies for rate limiting, attack mitigation, and session integrity.</li>
            <li><strong>Basic preferences</strong>: we may remember your explicit choices such as language (中文 / English) via cookies or local storage.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h2">2. Local storage</h2>
          <p>We may use local storage to keep small preference items (such as language) so you don’t have to reselect them. It is not used for cross-site tracking.</p>

          <h2 class="h2">3. How to manage</h2>
          <ul>
            <li>You can view, delete, or block cookies/local storage in your browser settings.</li>
            <li>If you block essential cookies, some security mechanisms or page functions may not work.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="h2">4. Contact</h2>
          <p>If you have questions, use the <strong>Support</strong> page. For orders: <a href="mailto:orders@ordoinc.com">orders@ordoinc.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
